OL,3,GNEWSATeenage pedestrian killed in crash
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a teenager who was killed
OL,7,Fby a car in Leeds city centre have said
OL,8,Ftheir "hearts are broken".
OL,10,FRowan Carty, 18, from Beeston, died
OL,11,Fafter he was hit by a BMW i40 M50 on
OL,12,FPark Lane just after 21:10 BST on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said three men,
OL,16,Ftwo aged 22 and one aged 24, were
OL,17,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,18,Fby dangerous driving and had since been
OL,19,Fbailed pending further inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
