OL,3,GNEWSATeenage pedestrian killed in crash
OL,4,Anamed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim was taken to hospital but
OL,7,Fdied from his injuries. His family
OL,8,Fsaid: "We would like to thank members
OL,9,Fof the public and emergency services
OL,10,Ffor their efforts in trying to save
OL,11,FRowan's life."
